This repository ships code under multiple licenses; see below for the
per-component breakdown and refer to the individual license files for the
full text of each license.

=== Apache-2.0 (SAM 2, EfficientTAM, and this fork's code) =============
Applies to: the sam/ package (excluding SAM 3 components), EfficientTAM
            integration, tools/, notebooks/, and all other non-SAM-3 code.
Full license text: LICENSE_apache2

=== BSD-3-Clause (CUDA connected-components extension) ==================
Applies to: sam/csrc/ (GPU connected-components algorithm adapted from
            cc_torch, github.com/zsef123/Connected_components_PyTorch).
Full license text: LICENSE_cctorch

=== SAM License (SAM 3 and derivatives) =================================
Applies to: SAM 3 model code, weights, and all code that derives from or
            imports SAM 3 components (identified by the
            "SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-SAM" header in each file).
            Using these components binds you to this license's terms,
            including acceptable-use and trade-control restrictions.
            SAM 3 weights are access-gated and never vendored in this repo.
Full license text: LICENSE_sam

=========================================================================
For the authoritative per-component license table and further details,
see the README (## License section) and the NOTICE file.
